cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this course, please use the following metadata."
title: "PFA — Persian as a Foreign Language (script stage, A1–B1)"
abstract: >-
  A free, openly-licensed reference course in Modern Persian (Farsi,
  standard Iranian variety) for German Gesamtschule learners and
  independent self-studiers. A pre-A1 script-onboarding stage covering
  the Perso-Arabic alphabet precedes CEFR levels A1, A2 and B1; units
  are traceable to descriptor identifiers of the boulingua curriculum
  framework. Persian is set in the native script throughout, with
  scaffolded transliteration that fades out after A1.
type: dataset
